Software Requirements Specification (SRS)

Project: TableMate AI – AI-Based Restaurant Table Booking Platform

⸻

1. Introduction

1.1 Purpose

The purpose of this project is to develop a fully functional AI-powered restaurant table booking platform that allows users to discover restaurants, view real-time table layouts, select preferred seating, and make reservations intelligently.

The platform combines:

* Restaurant discovery
* Real-time table reservation
* Interactive floor blueprint visualization
* Queue management
* AI recommendations
* Gamified discounts
* Admin management

The system must be production-style, scalable, responsive, and visually premium.

⸻

1.2 Scope

The platform will provide:

* User authentication
* Restaurant search by location
* Nearby restaurant discovery
* Interactive table blueprint booking
* Table category selection
* Queue notifications
* Puzzle-based discount rewards
* AI-driven recommendations
* Admin dashboard
* Booking analytics
* Bestseller table tracking

Target platforms:

* Desktop
* Tablet
* Mobile

⸻

1.3 Intended Audience

* Developers
* UI/UX Designers
* Testers
* Project Evaluators
* Restaurant Owners
* End Users

⸻

